==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] at Level 20+ can easily knockback the Shadow Boxer K before she can attack.

To easily beat this stage, send out 3 Paris Cats to kill the Gories, then begin saving for [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. After the Paris Cats reach 1/2 way across the battlefield, send out Bahamut Cat. When they begin attacking the enemy base, start spamming [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]]. Continue spamming meatshields and the occasional Paris to win.

